# The names of this project's keys and settings. NAMES only: never put a real value here,
# because this file is committed to git. Real values go in .env (or .env.local), which git ignores.
# To add a value, run this yourself in a terminal and paste the key when asked (it shows stars):
#   node .agents/scripts/keys.mjs add NAME
# To see which are set, without showing any value:  node .agents/scripts/keys.mjs
# AI coding agents never read .env. They read this file to learn the names.
# End a line with "# optional" if the app works without that key.
# Names starting with NEXT_PUBLIC_, VITE_, EXPO_PUBLIC_, REACT_APP_ or PUBLIC_ end up in the
# browser, where anyone can read them. Never give a secret one of those names.

